1
00:00:00,133 --> 00:00:03,733
Red rain?

2
00:00:04,167 --> 00:00:06,867
Colored water,
or tiny particles?

3
00:00:07,167 --> 00:00:10,867
Suspended particles,
not dissolved color.

4
00:00:11,167 --> 00:00:13,867
Then researchers
cultured these particles...

5
00:00:15,500 --> 00:00:17,667
Algae grew!

6
00:00:18,167 --> 00:00:21,867
The red particles were
identified as algal spores.

7
00:00:22,167 --> 00:00:25,867
The same kind was found
on nearby trees.

8
00:00:26,167 --> 00:00:29,867
How so many reached the air
is still not fully explained.

9
00:00:30,167 --> 00:00:33,833
Tiny biological particles
gave this rain its red color.
